#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0146B expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "PARAMN is not declared, so not empty(PARAMN) is false on every row (an absent column folds to all-missing) and the rule is EXECUTED-and-silent even though the degraded key would otherwise collapse the dataset into one group and flag row 3. No Requirements.Variables block on this rule, so noViolation, NOT skipped -- the observable difference from sibling PMDA-AD0147B."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col PARAM   type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | ALB | Albumin
S1 | 002 | ALB | Albumin
S1 | 003 | ALB | Bilirubin
